# Commands run by the launchd job com.hakios.demo (see com.hakios.demo.plist).
# Metal on the Adreno 640 (an image built with METAL=1, a boot with metal=1 or metal=3), where nothing can
# run commands by hand (`xl sh` needs usbctld and a loader with usbctl): the device a program gets and a GPU
# blit, then a real Metal program (24 checks, "metal_app: ALL PASS") and the ASTC samples, all into the
# console. Once SpringBoard is up, so that the window server holds the GPU as it does in use.
/redwood/bin/sound_test springboard
/redwood/bin/rwtouch wait 10
/redwood/bin/metal_test device
/redwood/bin/metal_test app /redwood/share/metal/task9.metallib
/redwood/bin/metal_test astc /redwood/share/metal/astc.metallib
